  "title": "Baked Buffalo Chicken Dip",
  "description": "This baked Buffalo chicken dip from Chef John is easy to make with shredded chicken, cream cheese, blue cheese, and hot sauce for a crowd-pleasing dip.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
